03:23.300 --> 03:25.930
That's what I keep telling you!

03:25.930 --> 03:29.100
Even nerds should carry a rubber around.

03:29.100 --> 03:30.640
It's basic etiquette for a gentleman!

03:30.940 --> 03:34.400
Not that kind of prepared. I mean emotionally.

03:34.400 --> 03:37.110
Emotionally?! You think 
you're some virtuous maiden?

03:37.110 --> 03:41.320
You're totally unpopular, and you 
passed up this one precious chance?

03:41.320 --> 03:43.680
Yeah, but you know,

03:43.680 --> 03:47.790
if we're going to be dating a while, 
I'm sure I'll get another opportunity.

03:47.790 --> 03:53.560
Kasshi, you seriously think a dude like you 
can really date Shirakawa-san?

03:53.560 --> 03:54.250
