06:18.540 --> 06:21.570
Huh? U-Um... weekends?

06:22.230 --> 06:25.050
Like, outside of school or something?

06:25.820 --> 06:27.980
<i>What! What am I saying?</i>

06:27.980 --> 06:31.910
<i>A nerd like me can't hog Shirakawa-san 
on weekends! I'm way out of line!</i>

06:32.200 --> 06:34.370
You mean like on dates?

06:34.370 --> 06:35.050
Bwate?!

06:35.050 --> 06:37.780
