You invited me, remember?

07:24.460 --> 07:26.550
<i>Oh. Yeah.</i>

07:26.550 --> 07:28.850
<i>So for the date, where are we going?</i>

07:30.590 --> 07:35.280
<i>It's our first date. A m-movie or something?</i>

07:35.280 --> 07:39.020
Oh, you like movies? What kind?

07:39.020 --> 07:41.060
<i>Huh? Uh, yeah, um...</i>

07:42.260 --> 07:46.130
<i>I only go to movies like 
