Don't make me blush.

10:45.040 --> 10:47.620
I guess you are kind of unusual, Ryuto.

10:48.080 --> 10:51.580
<i>What am I gonna do? 
I really like Shirakawa-san.</i>

10:51.900 --> 10:56.930
<i>I was always interested, but now that we're 
