11:14.810 --> 11:16.730
<i>...that's what she's hearing?</i>

11:16.730 --> 11:21.820
Totally. But hey, remember before?

11:23.160 --> 11:27.000
<i>Yeah, I knew there's no way 
Shirakawa-san would actually fall for me.</i>

11:27.000 --> 11:29.900
