from responding for four hours?

12:00.780 --> 12:06.990
Extrovert

12:01.130 --> 12:03.900
You done toying with that nerd, babe?

12:03.900 --> 12:06.950
Then I get you all to myself today.

12:10.700 --> 12:13.560
<i>Okay! Nice. Okay. Right there.</i>

12:11.190 --> 12:13.840
Fine, then! At least KEN won't betray me.

12:13.840 --> 12:17.170
He uploads new videos 
every day and even does live streams!

12:17.170 --> 12:22.650
Oh, KEN! KEN! KEN! KEN! KEN! KEN! KEN! KEN!

12:26.350 --> 12:28.780
Kasshi, you were on fire yesterday.

12:28.780 --> 12:30.830
You're a role model for 
KEN Kids everywhere, bro!

12:30.830 --> 12:32.020
Yeah, I guess.

12:32.020 --> 12:34.570
Soccer club, huh?

12:34.570 --> 12:36.230
You should come to watch practice.

12:36.730 --> 12:39.280
Yeah, I don't really know the rules, though.

12:39.280 --> 12:41.190
You don't need to! You're good.

12:41.600 --> 12:47.480
<i>When Shirakawa-san finally got 
