like you, Kashima-kun.

16:38.630 --> 16:43.180
I started thinking she felt the same way.
 It kinda went to my head.

16:44.020 --> 16:47.830
Kurose-san, I like you! Please go out with me!

16:49.600 --> 16:50.840
